              "message": "unknown component — use one of Section, Stack, Grid, Split, Carousel, Tabs, Disclosure, Divider, Text, Heading, Image, Gallery, Logo, Badge, Rating, Price, Status, Callout, Quote, Code, FileRef, Sources, Stat, KeyValue, Table, Chart, Meter, Timeline, Steps, Progress, Value, Card, Hero, List, Map, Filters, Segmented, Toggle, Slider, Stepper, Select, Field, Checklist, Choice, Form, Actions",
